{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["The sense of <b>who smote Midian in the field of Moab</b> is to declare his valor: the Midianites came into the field of Moab to fortify themselves together with them, and he prevailed against all of them. <b>And Baal Hanan son of Achbor</b> was from a place called Shaul; therefore no other city is mentioned for him. And it is possible that Hanan is a place, and he was its baal (lord), and after that he reigned:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:21:58.377779345Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}